    "detailed_description": "\u25a0Story<br />\r\nThis is a tale of wizards fighting against monsters that have suddenly begun to appear.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKaito, a young, bullied boy, meets wizards of different professions: a parttime teacher, a waitress, a retired soldier, and a suspicious dealer of information. What lies ahead for them as their different ways of thinking, emotions, and lifestyles come together?<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25a0Game Features<br />\r\n-Turned-Based RPG <br />\r\nBattles combine real time and turn-based combat.<br />\r\nTime your blocks correctly to defend against enemy attacks!<br />\r\nRead your enemies\u2019 actions and seize victory!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Magic System<br />\r\nBecome stronger the more you use magic.<br />\r\nUnlock new kinds of magic as you level up, progress in the story, and even in the middle of combat.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Level Cleared Adventure<br />\r\nOnce you\u2019ve cleared a level, you can replay it as many times as you want!<br />\r\nYou can revisit the past by reviewing the story, and level up when you\u2019re stuck in battle somewhere.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Beautiful, moving events<br />\r\nEnjoy all of the many scenes showing off the characters\u2019 living, breathing dialogue.<br />\r\nYou can also skip over messages, set it to autoplay, and even remove the UI from the screen.<br />\r\nDive into the scenes and live the game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-An expansive world<br />\r\nThis game is the sequel to HIBIKAKEYIRONOKISEKI, which has been downloaded more than a hundred thousand times!<br />\r\nIt features an upgraded game system based on the previous game in the series.<br />\r\nSome characters from the previous game appear and you can see how their stories continue.<br />\r\n(This game can be enjoyed without playing the previous game.)",
    "about_the_game": "\u25a0Story<br />\r\nThis is a tale of wizards fighting against monsters that have suddenly begun to appear.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKaito, a young, bullied boy, meets wizards of different professions: a parttime teacher, a waitress, a retired soldier, and a suspicious dealer of information. What lies ahead for them as their different ways of thinking, emotions, and lifestyles come together?<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25a0Game Features<br />\r\n-Turned-Based RPG <br />\r\nBattles combine real time and turn-based combat.<br />\r\nTime your blocks correctly to defend against enemy attacks!<br />\r\nRead your enemies\u2019 actions and seize victory!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Magic System<br />\r\nBecome stronger the more you use magic.<br />\r\nUnlock new kinds of magic as you level up, progress in the story, and even in the middle of combat.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Level Cleared Adventure<br />\r\nOnce you\u2019ve cleared a level, you can replay it as many times as you want!<br />\r\nYou can revisit the past by reviewing the story, and level up when you\u2019re stuck in battle somewhere.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Beautiful, moving events<br />\r\nEnjoy all of the many scenes showing off the characters\u2019 living, breathing dialogue.<br />\r\nYou can also skip over messages, set it to autoplay, and even remove the UI from the screen.<br />\r\nDive into the scenes and live the game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-An expansive world<br />\r\nThis game is the sequel to HIBIKAKEYIRONOKISEKI, which has been downloaded more than a hundred thousand times!<br />\r\nIt features an upgraded game system based on the previous game in the series.<br />\r\nSome characters from the previous game appear and you can see how their stories continue.<br />\r\n(This game can be enjoyed without playing the previous game.)",
